# Accounting: Rental property depreciation (simplified)

Load examples/accounting/data/asset_record.txt as Property Record

Find cost basis and save as cost_basis
Find land value and save as land_value
Find service month and save as service_month

cost_basis equals 0 if cost_basis == nil
land_value equals 0 if land_value == nil
service_month equals 1 if service_month == nil

depreciable_basis equals cost_basis minus land_value
recovery_period equals 27.5
annual_depreciation equals depreciable_basis / recovery_period
months_in_service equals 12 minus service_month plus 0.5
first_year_depreciation equals annual_depreciation * months_in_service / 12

depreciable_basis must be at least 1

Route first_year_depreciation to accounting_rental_depreciation_queue
